Scope

The MIT License above covers the source code of this repository. It does not
cover the written content, project notes, curriculum vitae, or research
figures in site/content and site/public, which remain the work of Priyanshu
Kumar; figures taken from published articles are also subject to the terms of
those articles.

The sepsis mortality estimates in site/data and site/public/data are derived
from Rudd KE, et al. Global, regional, and national sepsis incidence and
mortality, 1990-2017: analysis for the Global Burden of Disease Study.
Lancet 2020; 395: 200-11. doi:10.1016/S0140-6736(19)32989-7, licensed under
CC BY 4.0. Country boundaries are from Natural Earth (public domain).
